---
title: WriteOff State Machine
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Draft : Warehouse Keeper creates request (batch, quantity, reason)
    Draft --> Draft : update items or attach evidence
    Draft --> Submitted : submit for review with supporting evidence
    Draft --> Cancelled : cancel an editable draft
    Submitted --> Approved : Admin approves write-off
    Submitted --> Rejected : Admin rejects (reason required)
    Rejected --> Draft : revise and resubmit
    Rejected --> [*]
    Approved --> Processed : WriteOff/Damaged inventory transaction posted, OnHand decreases
    Processed --> [*]
    Cancelled --> [*]
